WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:03.242
Unit nineteen. Helping at Home!

2
00:00:04.252 --> 00:00:09.136
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.186 --> 00:00:12.738
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.788 --> 00:00:16.541
Today we learn: Helping at Home. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.616 --> 00:00:21.166
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

6
00:00:24.674 --> 00:00:28.324
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

7
00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:35.001
Cook. Say it with me. Cook!

8
00:00:38.501 --> 00:00:41.967
Tidy. Say it with me. Tidy!

9
00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:48.534
Chore. Say it with me. Chore!

10
00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:54.934
Help. Say it with me. Help!

11
00:00:58.434 --> 00:01:02.934
Responsible. Say it with me. Responsible!

12
00:01:06.435 --> 00:01:10.102
Family. Say it with me. Family!

13
00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:22.712
Grammar time! I help + verb. Listen. I help clean. I help cook.

14
00:01:22.762 --> 00:01:28.544
Your turn. Say it with me. I help clean. I help cook.

15
00:01:33.464 --> 00:01:44.159
I help my family at home. I clean my room and tidy my toys. Sometimes I help wash the dishes or help cook dinner. Doing chores makes me feel responsible.

16
00:01:44.209 --> 00:01:45.559
I like this story!

17
00:01:46.234 --> 00:01:51.582
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.632 --> 00:01:52.782
Cook!

19
00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:59.058
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:59.108 --> 00:02:00.447
Responsible!

21
00:02:01.590 --> 00:02:09.354
Think and answer. What chore do you help with at home?

22
00:02:09.404 --> 00:02:10.554
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.659 --> 00:02:14.461
This unit's value is Responsibility.

24
00:02:14.511 --> 00:02:16.775
I can show responsibility every day!

25
00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:24.335
Well done! You finished Pre A one! See you in A one!

26
00:02:24.385 --> 00:02:27.408
Hooray! Bye-bye, friends!

